--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Cryptographic construction inherited from the Servanda protocol: Ed25519
signatures, SLIP-0010 key derivation, and RFC 8785 (JCS) canonicalization with
SHA-256. No new cryptography is invented in this project; that is deliberate.

The SLIP-0010 test vectors under spec/vectors/ use the seed values published in
the SLIP-0010 specification itself. They are public test data, not key material.
See spec/vectors/README.md.
